### Admin Returns API Tests

### 1. Get Grouped Returns (with default to today's date)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/returns/admin/grouped-returns
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Get Grouped Returns with specific filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/returns/admin/grouped-returns?Year=2024&Month=12&SaccoType=DT&Frequency=Monthly
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Get Grouped Returns with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/returns/admin/grouped-returns?Page=1&PageSize=10
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Get specific group details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/returns/admin/grouped-returns/rating-def-id-123/period-id-456/sacco-id-789
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Get filter options - Years
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/returns/admin/filter-options/years
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Get filter options - SACCO Types
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/returns/admin/filter-options/sacco-types
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. Get filter options - Frequencies
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/returns/admin/filter-options/frequencies
Content-Type: application/json

